        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/ios-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We’re just a few days away from <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/ios-27/\">Apple’s official iOS 27 announcement</a>. The update is expected to introduce new features across many Apple apps and Siri. Apple Wallet is one of the most important apps for many iPhone users, and iOS 27 will reportedly add two key new features.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-wallet,ios,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1054333\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/03/ios-27-will-reportedly-add-two-major-new-features-to-apple-wallet/#more-1054333\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
