        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-watch-running-challenge-1.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">June is here, and with the new month comes the next Apple Watch activity challenge. Meanwhile, Apple Fitness+ has added a new treadmill workout for subscribers.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-fitness,apple-health,apple-watch\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1053448\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/03/global-running-day-challenge-coming-to-apple-watch-next-week/#more-1053448\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
