        "title": "MagSafe Monday: Why the PISEN 5000mAh battery pack is great for everyday carry",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/01/magsafe-monday-why-the-pisen-5000mah-battery-pack-is-great-for-everyday-carry/",
