        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/03/storm-radar.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In April, The Weather Channel released a new version of its Storm Radar app, introducing a customizable AI weather presenter and much more. More recently, Storm Radar has arrived on Apple Watch.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ipad,iphone,weather\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1046035\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/04/the-weather-channels-storm-radar-app-lets-you-build-your-own-ai-weather-presenter/#more-1046035\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
