        "title": "The Tidy House",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/the-tidy-house/",
        "content_text": "DJ Patil has spent the past several months on a listening tour. Wherever he travels, he finds a local university, pings faculty and students and anyone else who wants to show up, and runs an AMA. He&#8217;s heard from grad students who can&#8217;t get callbacks, hospital administrators dealing with federal policy changes that land like [&#8230;]",
