        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"597\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?fit=1024%2C597&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?w=2400&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=300%2C175&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=1024%2C597&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=768%2C448&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=1536%2C896&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=2048%2C1195&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=1200%2C700&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=2000%2C1167&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=780%2C455&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=400%2C233&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?resize=706%2C412&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?w=2340&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Copy-of-Brendan_Longreads_Draft_ONeill-1.png?fit=1024%2C597&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>How organized crime fell in love with cheese.",
