        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/cash-app-wand.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No, it’s not an April Fools’ Day gag in June as far as we can tell. Cash App has launched a tap-and-pay magic wand keychain accessory for contactless payments.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1054527\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/04/cash-app-launches-a-payment-wand-for-when-apple-pay-just-isnt-magical-enough/#more-1054527\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
