        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/02/ios-27-could-make-airpods-a-lot-more-powerful-with-one-upgrade/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/airpods-pro-3-black-background.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27’s unveiling is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/05/27/how-to-watch-apples-wwdc-keynote-ios-27-new-siri-and-more/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1053594\">almost here</a>, and Siri’s major <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/04/01/ios-27s-new-siri-is-coming-and-sounds-very-much-worth-the-wait/\">overhaul</a> is set to make not only the iPhone feel far more powerful, but AirPods too.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"airpods,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1050182\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/02/ios-27-could-make-airpods-a-lot-more-powerful-with-one-upgrade/#more-1050182\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
